WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.699 --> 00:00:05.399
Fenn! Fenn!

2
00:00:05.466 --> 00:00:09.500
- Can I have a turn, please?
- Of course. Here.

3
00:00:09.566 --> 00:00:13.200
Ah! Does that feel good, Fennekin?

4
00:00:13.266 --> 00:00:15.000
Fenn! Fenn!

5
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.166
- Huh?
- Chespin! Che!

6
00:00:18.233 --> 00:00:21.233
I’ll bet you want to get brushed too, right?

7
00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:23.166
Pin! Che! Pin!

8
00:00:23.233 --> 00:00:24.633
Step right this way!

9
00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:27.533
Che!

10
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:31.333
She should be here any minute.

11
00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:37.866
Serena! Sorry we’re late!

12
00:00:37.933 --> 00:00:41.466
- I hope that you weren’t waiting long.
- No, It’s fine!

13
00:00:42.466 --> 00:00:45.800
- Shauna, how have you been?
- Nice to see you again!

14
00:00:45.866 --> 00:00:49.000
- Last time was at summer camp!
- Yeah, the memories!

15
00:00:49.066 --> 00:00:52.633
- Great to see all of you!
- So what are you going to show us today?

16
00:00:52.699 --> 00:00:57.033
Wait till you hear this! Aria’s going to do an exhibition performance

17
00:00:57.099 --> 00:01:00.833
at the Pokémon Showcase right here in Lagoon Town!

18
00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:04.033
So I wanted to invite all of you to come with me!

19
00:01:04.099 --> 00:01:07.766
- Aria? Awesome!
- Her PokéVision videos are great!

20
00:01:07.833 --> 00:01:12.233
Yeah! She’s the top Pokémon performer, the Kalos Queen!

21
00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:14.933
I can’t wait to see her!

22
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:17.866
♪ I want to be the very best ♪

23
00:01:17.933 --> 00:01:21.433
♪ Like no one ever was ♪

24
00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:24.033
♪ To catch them is my real test ♪

25
00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:27.233
♪ To train them is my cause ♪

26
00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:30.366
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all It's you and me ♪

27
00:01:30.433 --> 00:01:33.566
♪ Pokémon! I know it's my destiny ♪

28
00:01:33.633 --> 00:01:36.933
♪ Pokémon! Yeah, you're my best friend ♪

29
00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:39.666
♪ In a world we must defend ♪

30
00:01:39.733 --> 00:01:41.866
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all ♪

31
00:01:41.933 --> 00:01:44.933
♪ Got to catch them all! Pokémon! ♪

32
00:01:55.133 --> 00:01:58.266
As our heroes continue their journey to the Coumarine City Gym,

33
00:01:58.333 --> 00:02:01.733
where Ash will be vying for his fourth Kalos Gym badge,

34
00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:04.466
their friend Shauna has invited them to come along with her

35
00:02:04.533 --> 00:02:07.666
to see the Lagoon Town Pokémon Showcase!

36
00:02:09.566 --> 00:02:12.266
I can’t wait to see all the Pokémon perform!

37
00:02:12.333 --> 00:02:14.466
Will there be a bunch of different Pokémon?

38
00:02:14.533 --> 00:02:17.666
- Lots of them!
- Dedenne, let’s watch it together!

39
00:02:17.733 --> 00:02:19.866
Na-na-na!

40
00:02:24.166 --> 00:02:26.266
It’s starting!

41
00:02:28.066 --> 00:02:30.600
I give! What’s a Pokémon Showcase anyway?

42
00:02:30.666 --> 00:02:34.100
Well, Trainers and their Pokémon give various kinds of performances.

43
00:02:34.166 --> 00:02:38.333
It sounds intriguing, but we’ll just see how good they are at their craft.

44
00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:41.533
You talk like you’re a performance expert.

45
00:02:41.600 --> 00:02:42.833
'Cause I am.

46
00:02:42.900 --> 00:02:46.866
Bonjour, Pokémon lovers, and welcome!

47
00:02:46.933 --> 00:02:50.299
I am your humble host, Monsieur Pierre.

48
00:02:50.366 --> 00:02:53.733
Prepare yourselves for a competition magnifique!

49
00:02:53.799 --> 00:02:58.266
And now... the Lagoon Town Pokémon Showcase will amaze,

50
00:02:58.333 --> 00:03:01.433
starting things up with our Rookie Class Division!

51
00:03:02.866 --> 00:03:07.566
But first, our reigning Kalos Queen, Mademoiselle Aria, has agreed

52
00:03:07.633 --> 00:03:11.133
to put on an exhibition performance for one and all!

53
00:03:13.966 --> 00:03:16.299
Be fantastic!

54
00:03:17.799 --> 00:03:19.700
Ooh!

55
00:03:24.166 --> 00:03:25.166
Pin!

56
00:03:25.233 --> 00:03:28.299
Look! Aria’s Fennekin’s evolved into Braixen!

57
00:03:28.366 --> 00:03:30.166
That’s what it evolves into.

58
00:03:31.166 --> 00:03:35.200
Braixen, the Fox Pokémon, and the evolved form of Fennekin.

59
00:03:35.266 --> 00:03:38.966
To defeat its opponent, Braixen combines the flame from the twig in its tail

60
00:03:39.033 --> 00:03:42.266
with its fiery breath, creating a massive Fire Spin.

61
00:03:42.333 --> 00:03:45.266
- Use Fire Spin!
- Braixen!

62
00:03:46.600 --> 00:03:48.399
And here she comes,

63
00:03:48.466 --> 00:03:53.766
our beautiful Kalos Queen, Mademoiselle Aria!

64
00:03:53.833 --> 00:03:56.766
There she is!

65
00:03:56.833 --> 00:03:58.933
Braixen!

66
00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:10.133
- Ha-ha!
- Fennekin!

67
00:04:16.666 --> 00:04:19.966
- Ha!
- Braixen!

68
00:04:20.033 --> 00:04:22.966
And for our finish, Fire Blast!

69
00:04:23.033 --> 00:04:25.300
Braixen!

70
00:04:30.433 --> 00:04:33.800
Magnifique! Another stunning performance

71
00:04:33.866 --> 00:04:38.366
from our Kalos Queen, Mademoiselle Aria!

72
00:04:38.433 --> 00:04:39.566
- Pika!
- Perfect!

73
00:04:39.633 --> 00:04:41.266
Such precise moves!

74
00:04:41.333 --> 00:04:42.900
- Na-na!
- She’s so great!

75
00:04:42.966 --> 00:04:47.566
And so we say merci to Mademoiselle Aria and Braixen!

76
00:04:47.633 --> 00:04:49.433
Adieu and a bientôt!

77
00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:52.700
Hot stuff! She’s not queen for nothing!

78
00:04:52.766 --> 00:04:58.033
Hm! Oh, really? Against me, she’s nothing that special.

79
00:04:58.099 --> 00:05:02.300
Alors! Now that everyone is all revved up and ready to go,

80
00:05:02.366 --> 00:05:05.466
please welcome today’s first performer,

81
00:05:05.533 --> 00:05:10.400
from Brindille Town, Kaleigh and her partner Furfrou!

82
00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:13.900
Furfrou!

83
00:05:13.966 --> 00:05:17.466
Remember? The Pokémon Showcase is made up of two competitions.

84
00:05:17.533 --> 00:05:19.466
If your Theme Performance is good enough,

85
00:05:19.533 --> 00:05:22.900
you move on to General Freestyle Performance.

86
00:05:22.966 --> 00:05:25.599
So that decides who’s good enough to move on.

87
00:05:25.666 --> 00:05:28.633
Furfrou, use Double Team!

88
00:05:28.700 --> 00:05:31.633
Furfrou!

89
00:05:33.266 --> 00:05:35.133
-Huh?

90
00:05:36.833 --> 00:05:38.866
- Pancham, Pancham!
- Huh?

91
00:05:38.933 --> 00:05:40.966
Oh no! What’s this?

92
00:05:41.033 --> 00:05:44.800
I can’t believe it! That Pancham is crashing the performance!

93
00:05:46.599 --> 00:05:47.966
Huh?

94
00:05:49.166 --> 00:05:51.800
Hey! There’s a show going on!

95
00:05:51.866 --> 00:05:54.166
Cha! Cha!

96
00:05:54.233 --> 00:05:57.066
- Whoa! Ah!
- Cha! Cha!

97
00:05:57.133 --> 00:06:00.200
Huh? Pancham! Pancham!

98
00:06:00.266 --> 00:06:02.833
- Huh?
- Pancham!

99
00:06:02.900 --> 00:06:06.000
What’s up with that? That Pancham’s wild!

100
00:06:09.099 --> 00:06:10.766
Too bad it ended early.

101
00:06:10.833 --> 00:06:13.366
But at least we got to see Aria’s performance!

102
00:06:13.433 --> 00:06:17.000
I thought the teamwork between her and her Braixen was as good as it gets!

103
00:06:17.066 --> 00:06:20.966
- They were both so great!
- You’re right. They were really cool!

104
00:06:21.033 --> 00:06:24.200
The way she used that flaming twig was fantastic!

105
00:06:24.266 --> 00:06:27.966
- Dedenne can do that. Right, Dedenne?
- Na-na-na-na!

106
00:06:28.033 --> 00:06:29.700
I’m so glad we saw her!

107
00:06:29.766 --> 00:06:33.866
We got some great ideas for our own Pokémon Showcase performance!

108
00:06:33.933 --> 00:06:34.966
Bulbasaur!

109
00:06:35.033 --> 00:06:37.433
You mean you’re really going to be a part of it?

110
00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:40.433
Mm-hm, but we’ve still got a lot of work to do.

111
00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:44.133
We’re going to have to head home now. I’ll be in touch soon!

112
00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:47.200
- Thanks a lot for inviting us!
- Bye!

113
00:06:47.266 --> 00:06:50.400
- Hurry up, Bulbasaur!
- Bulba! Bulbasaur!

114
00:06:51.400 --> 00:06:55.066
Shauna’s finally taking the next step.

115
00:06:55.133 --> 00:06:58.799
- Pika?
- Che! Chespin!

116
00:06:58.866 --> 00:07:01.833
- Are you imitating Braixen?
- Chespin!

117
00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:04.333
Che? Che!

118
00:07:06.166 --> 00:07:08.133
- Che! Che?
- Huh?

119
00:07:08.200 --> 00:07:10.299
- Huh?
- Chespin!

120
00:07:10.366 --> 00:07:13.033
- Pancham!
- Uh, is that...

121
00:07:13.099 --> 00:07:15.766
The same Pancham who crashed the show?

122
00:07:15.833 --> 00:07:17.233
Che, Chespin!

123
00:07:17.299 --> 00:07:20.299
Cha!

124
00:07:22.466 --> 00:07:25.366
Che? Chespin, Pin, Pin! Che, Che, Che!

125
00:07:25.433 --> 00:07:27.966
- Huh? Chespin!
- Chespin!

126
00:07:28.033 --> 00:07:31.466
- Chespin, wait!
- Where are you going?

127
00:07:32.733 --> 00:07:36.466
- Chespin?
- Pika!

128
00:07:36.533 --> 00:07:39.766
Come on, guys, don’t leave me behind, please!

129
00:07:39.833 --> 00:07:41.700
There’s a fork in the road!

130
00:07:41.766 --> 00:07:44.700
- Okay, I’ll go look for Chespin this way!
- Fennekin!

131
00:07:44.766 --> 00:07:47.266
- Right!
- Pika! Pika!

132
00:07:47.333 --> 00:07:50.633
- Finally!
- I think we should go and look this way!

133
00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:52.966
- Na-na-na!
- Huh?

134
00:07:53.033 --> 00:07:55.799
- Hey, Chespin!
- Pika! Pika!

135
00:07:55.866 --> 00:07:58.400
Huh?

136
00:07:58.466 --> 00:08:00.500
- Pancham!
- Pika!

137
00:08:00.566 --> 00:08:02.766
-Cha, cha, cha!

138
00:08:02.833 --> 00:08:04.500
Ah! My hat!

139
00:08:04.566 --> 00:08:07.466
Hey! Chespin!

140
00:08:09.933 --> 00:08:13.400
- Cha! Cha!
- Whoa! Huh?

141
00:08:13.466 --> 00:08:17.133
- Cha, cha, cha!
- Hey! Huh?

142
00:08:17.200 --> 00:08:20.166
I can’t see without my glasses!

143
00:08:20.233 --> 00:08:23.066
Argh! Oh! I’m sorry! I'm sorry!

144
00:08:23.133 --> 00:08:26.500
- I’m sorry!
- Clemont? Uh, that’s a big rock!

145
00:08:28.933 --> 00:08:31.766
- Chespin, is that you?
- Fennekin!

146
00:08:31.833 --> 00:08:35.166
- Did you find it, Fennekin?
- Fenne!

147
00:08:35.233 --> 00:08:38.000
Huh? What’s the matter?

148
00:08:46.100 --> 00:08:48.566
Pancham!

149
00:08:48.633 --> 00:08:52.000
That hat! Those glasses!

150
00:08:52.066 --> 00:08:54.533
Pan! Cha! Pancham!

151
00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:58.666
Whoa! Cham! Pancham!

152
00:08:58.733 --> 00:09:00.733
What’s Pancham up to?

153
00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:12.300
Of course! Pancham really likes to perform. That explains it.

154
00:09:12.366 --> 00:09:17.100
Pancham, Pancha, cha! Pan, cha! Pan, cha! Pan, cha, cha, cha!

155
00:09:17.166 --> 00:09:19.233
- Hey, Pancham!
- Cha?

156
00:09:19.300 --> 00:09:21.466
Cha, cha, cha, cha! -Wait!

157
00:09:21.533 --> 00:09:24.733
I just want to have a talk with you!

158
00:09:24.800 --> 00:09:27.633
-Hey! Look at that!

159
00:09:29.733 --> 00:09:35.199
Pancham, have you been gathering up all of these things for your performances?

160
00:09:35.266 --> 00:09:37.800
You shouldn’t steal other people’s things.

161
00:09:37.866 --> 00:09:42.866
But if you promise me you’ll stop stealing, I’ll give you these!

162
00:09:43.866 --> 00:09:48.333
- Cha!
- A perfect fit. They look great!

163
00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:52.433
- Ha? Pancha!
- Huh? Pancham, come back!

164
00:09:52.500 --> 00:09:54.766
I’m not done talking to you!

165
00:09:54.833 --> 00:09:58.366
-Now, where could that Pancham have gone?

166
00:09:58.433 --> 00:10:01.133
- Na-na-na!
- Huh? Over there?

167
00:10:01.199 --> 00:10:03.233
Huh? Wait for me!

168
00:10:03.300 --> 00:10:05.233
Pin! Che! Chespin!

169
00:10:05.300 --> 00:10:08.433
Huh? Hey, Chespin! So there you are!

170
00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:10.966
- Chespin!
- So, where’s Pancham?

171
00:10:11.033 --> 00:10:12.500
You need to calm down.

172
00:10:12.566 --> 00:10:15.666
But I need my glasses to see.

173
00:10:15.733 --> 00:10:17.966
- Clemont! Bonnie!
- Huh?

174
00:10:18.033 --> 00:10:21.199
- Pika! Pika!
- All right! Finally!

175
00:10:21.266 --> 00:10:23.699
Huh? Clemont, where are your glasses?

176
00:10:23.766 --> 00:10:25.733
That Pancham stole them.

177
00:10:25.800 --> 00:10:27.966
Pancham’s been busy!

178
00:10:28.033 --> 00:10:31.833
- You mean it got you as well?
- I’ve got to get my glasses back.

179
00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:34.966
Or I’ll end up making conversation with trees and rocks!

180
00:10:35.033 --> 00:10:37.966
Just relax!

181
00:10:48.933 --> 00:10:50.166
There it is!

182
00:10:50.233 --> 00:10:54.000
Pancham’s taking a nap without a care in the world.

183
00:10:54.066 --> 00:10:55.533
- Pika?
- Huh?

184
00:10:55.600 --> 00:10:58.266
Che! Che! Che!

185
00:10:58.333 --> 00:11:01.533
- Chespin! Che!
- Huh?

186
00:11:01.600 --> 00:11:03.900
- You’re not getting away now!
- Cha!

187
00:11:03.966 --> 00:11:08.433
- Give me back my hat!
- And give me back my glasses right now!

188
00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:11.600
Chespin!

189
00:11:11.666 --> 00:11:14.066
- Guys! Hold on a second!
- Huh?

190
00:11:14.133 --> 00:11:15.866
- Huh?
- Serena?

191
00:11:15.933 --> 00:11:19.366
Step aside. I want to catch that Pancham!

192
00:11:19.433 --> 00:11:20.933
Huh?

193
00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:24.300
Who’s that Pokémon?

194
00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:30.699
It’s Braixen!

195
00:11:35.100 --> 00:11:38.000
You heard me. I want to catch that Pancham!

196
00:11:38.066 --> 00:11:39.699
Why do you want to do that?

197
00:11:39.766 --> 00:11:44.466
When I found that Pancham near its cave, I discovered that it likes to perform.

198
00:11:44.533 --> 00:11:48.199
- Pancham likes to perform?
- Pancham!

199
00:11:48.266 --> 00:11:51.900
Guys, look! I managed to get your glasses and hat back.

200
00:11:51.966 --> 00:11:53.933
- Thanks.
- Thanks.

201
00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:55.633
But how did you find them?

202
00:11:55.699 --> 00:11:58.833
After it took them, Pancham was using them as props

203
00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:02.233
while it practiced performing near a lake!

204
00:12:02.300 --> 00:12:05.000
I know why it crashed the Pokémon Showcase.

205
00:12:05.066 --> 00:12:08.233
Pancham wanted everybody to see what a good performer it is!

206
00:12:08.300 --> 00:12:09.500
Cha?

207
00:12:09.566 --> 00:12:11.566
I see.

208
00:12:11.633 --> 00:12:14.199
- Pancham, is that the truth?
- Cham!

209
00:12:14.266 --> 00:12:15.900
Cham!

210
00:12:15.966 --> 00:12:21.766
And you have the most adorable smile I’ve ever seen! So, am I right?

211
00:12:21.833 --> 00:12:25.166
- Am I?
- Cham, cham, cham!

212
00:12:25.233 --> 00:12:26.866
I know what I want to do!

213
00:12:26.933 --> 00:12:32.233
I want to be a Pokémon performer, like Aria, with Pancham as my partner!

214
00:12:32.300 --> 00:12:34.766
Awesome! You really found your own dream!

215
00:12:34.833 --> 00:12:38.866
- Perfect! Sounds like a wonderful idea!
- Yippee! I’m all for it!

216
00:12:38.933 --> 00:12:40.599
- Na-na-na!
- Chespin!

217
00:12:40.666 --> 00:12:43.133
Mm-hm. Pancham?

218
00:12:46.966 --> 00:12:49.699
- Huh?
- I’d like to catch you.

219
00:12:49.766 --> 00:12:51.500
Cha?

220
00:12:51.566 --> 00:12:55.500
Fennekin, we’re going to battle Pancham.

221
00:12:55.566 --> 00:12:57.133
Fennekin!

222
00:12:57.199 --> 00:12:59.199
Pancham!

223
00:13:03.666 --> 00:13:06.833
- You can do it, Serena!
- Hm!

224
00:13:06.900 --> 00:13:08.099
Pancham!

225
00:13:08.166 --> 00:13:11.599
Now, Fennekin, use Scratch!

226
00:13:11.666 --> 00:13:13.966
Fenn! Fenn!

227
00:13:15.533 --> 00:13:18.466
Fenn!

228
00:13:18.533 --> 00:13:20.133
- Huh?
- Fennekin!

229
00:13:20.199 --> 00:13:22.500
- Cha!
- Fennekin!

230
00:13:22.566 --> 00:13:24.133
Fenn!

231
00:13:24.199 --> 00:13:26.866
Prepare for trouble, you knew Fennekin’s name!

232
00:13:26.933 --> 00:13:29.133
So now it’s time to play our little game.

233
00:13:29.199 --> 00:13:31.633
To protect the world from devastation!

234
00:13:31.699 --> 00:13:34.633
To unite all people within our nation!

235
00:13:34.699 --> 00:13:37.533
To denounce the evils of truth and love!

236
00:13:37.599 --> 00:13:40.866
To extend our reach to the stars above!

237
00:13:40.933 --> 00:13:43.233
- Jessie!
- And James!

238
00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:46.066
Team Rocket blasts off at the speed of light!

239
00:13:46.133 --> 00:13:49.266
Surrender now or prepare for a well-performed fight!

240
00:13:49.333 --> 00:13:51.866
Meowth, that’s right!

241
00:13:52.866 --> 00:13:54.800
Team Rocket! Give Fennekin back!

242
00:13:54.866 --> 00:13:57.800
So you want to be a Pokémon performer like Aria?

243
00:13:57.866 --> 00:14:01.766
- You got a problem with that?
- Well, Jessie has a big problem.

244
00:14:01.833 --> 00:14:04.133
- I don’t care.
- Yeah. Beware!

245
00:14:04.199 --> 00:14:08.633
In order to be a successful Pokémon performer, one needs to be beautiful!

246
00:14:08.699 --> 00:14:11.233
Dressed in a beautiful gown,

247
00:14:11.300 --> 00:14:15.766
my beautiful self will bask in the spotlight with beautiful Braixen!

248
00:14:18.699 --> 00:14:22.633
It’s beauty times three, crowds will love what they see.

249
00:14:22.699 --> 00:14:27.133
Aria doesn’t hold a candle to magnificent me!

250
00:14:27.199 --> 00:14:29.033
What did you say?

251
00:14:29.099 --> 00:14:31.633
In other words, Fennekin’s where it should be!

252
00:14:31.699 --> 00:14:35.800
But take heart. I’ll make sure it evolves into Braixen. Toodle-oo!

253
00:14:35.866 --> 00:14:37.500
We beat you!

254
00:14:37.566 --> 00:14:42.266
- You can’t take Fennekin. Stop!
- Fletchinder, I choose you!

255
00:14:42.333 --> 00:14:44.199
- Fletch!
- Razor Wind, let’s go!

256
00:14:44.266 --> 00:14:47.133
Fletch! Fletch! Fletch! Fletch! Fletch! Fletch!

257
00:14:47.199 --> 00:14:50.300
Argh! Already?

258
00:14:57.199 --> 00:15:00.699
- Great job, Fletchinder!
- Fennekin!

259
00:15:00.766 --> 00:15:04.000
Pancham!

260
00:15:07.466 --> 00:15:09.400
- Oh!
- Pancham!

261
00:15:11.266 --> 00:15:14.400
- Why is Pancham on their side?
- Mind your own business!

262
00:15:14.466 --> 00:15:16.400
Cham! Pam! Pancham!

263
00:15:16.466 --> 00:15:19.533
It says we’re interrupting its battle with the twerpette.

264
00:15:19.599 --> 00:15:21.833
Huh? Wow, is that true?

265
00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:25.400
- How dare you!
- Well, interrupting is what we do!

266
00:15:25.466 --> 00:15:27.366
- Go, Pumpkaboo!
- Go, Inkay!

267
00:15:27.433 --> 00:15:29.566
- Pumpkaboo!
- Inkay!

268
00:15:29.633 --> 00:15:30.800
Psybeam, go!

269
00:15:30.866 --> 00:15:32.733
Inkay!

270
00:15:34.900 --> 00:15:36.766
Pumpkaboo, Shadow Ball!

271
00:15:38.733 --> 00:15:42.733
Pancham!

272
00:15:47.266 --> 00:15:49.966
- Awesome!
- Pancham’s amazing!

273
00:15:50.033 --> 00:15:52.800
- Pikachu! Let’s get Fennekin back!
- Pika!

274
00:15:52.866 --> 00:15:56.400
Cham! Pan!

275
00:15:56.466 --> 00:15:59.699
Let’s help out, too. Chespin, Pin Missile!

276
00:15:59.766 --> 00:16:02.166
Chespin!

277
00:16:02.233 --> 00:16:04.133
Huh?

278
00:16:11.800 --> 00:16:16.233
You bore me with your twerpness. Pumpkaboo, Shadow Ball!

279
00:16:16.300 --> 00:16:19.466
No, you don't!

280
00:16:21.733 --> 00:16:26.266
- Serena!
- I’ll be fine. Save Fennekin!

281
00:16:26.333 --> 00:16:29.033
- Cham!
- Pika!

282
00:16:29.099 --> 00:16:33.033
How dare you treat my Pumpkaboo like a volleyball?

283
00:16:33.099 --> 00:16:35.766
If you want games, then we’ll give you games.

284
00:16:35.833 --> 00:16:38.033
- Time for Leech Seed!
- Pumpka!

285
00:16:38.099 --> 00:16:40.033
- Oh!

286
00:16:42.300 --> 00:16:45.800
Cham! Pan!

287
00:16:45.866 --> 00:16:48.166
-Argh!

288
00:16:48.233 --> 00:16:50.366
Oh, Pumpkaboo!

289
00:16:50.433 --> 00:16:51.900
Cha!

290
00:16:51.966 --> 00:16:53.900
Pancham, thanks a lot!

291
00:16:53.966 --> 00:16:58.800
That’s two moves too many! Time for a twerp payback!

292
00:16:58.866 --> 00:17:01.266
Let’s wrap it up. Vine Whip!

293
00:17:01.333 --> 00:17:05.399
Chespin! Chespin!

294
00:17:08.099 --> 00:17:15.099
- All right, Pikachu, use Thunderbolt!
- Pikachu!

295
00:17:15.166 --> 00:17:19.200
Oh, well, I know I can win without Braixen, don’t you?

296
00:17:19.266 --> 00:17:21.566
Whatever. You think you’re an actress.

297
00:17:21.633 --> 00:17:22.966
Just fool ‘em.

298
00:17:23.033 --> 00:17:27.533
We’re blasting off again!

299
00:17:27.599 --> 00:17:29.466
Inkay!

300
00:17:31.899 --> 00:17:32.966
- Fennekin!
- Fennekin!

301
00:17:33.033 --> 00:17:35.133
Thank goodness you’re all right!

302
00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:38.566
Thanks, Pancham! You really helped Fennekin a lot.

303
00:17:38.633 --> 00:17:43.033
So now, what do you say we get back to having our battle?

304
00:17:43.100 --> 00:17:44.466
Pancham!

305
00:17:46.700 --> 00:17:48.100
Cham! Cham!

306
00:17:48.166 --> 00:17:50.633
- All right, Fennekin. You ready?
- Fenn!

307
00:17:54.433 --> 00:17:56.100
Dodge it!

308
00:17:57.566 --> 00:17:59.700
- Use Flamethrower!
- Fenn!

309
00:17:59.766 --> 00:18:02.633
Pan!

310
00:18:02.700 --> 00:18:05.066
Cha, cha, cha!

311
00:18:06.800 --> 00:18:09.100
- Flamethrower again!
- Fennekin!

312
00:18:09.166 --> 00:18:11.966
- Cha, cha, cha!
- Dodge it!

313
00:18:12.033 --> 00:18:14.500
- Huh?
- Now, Hidden Power!

314
00:18:14.566 --> 00:18:17.000
Fennekin!

315
00:18:17.066 --> 00:18:20.366
Pan!

316
00:18:20.433 --> 00:18:23.000
All right, Serena, use the Poké Ball!

317
00:18:24.000 --> 00:18:27.000
Got it, Ash. Poké Ball, let’s go!

318
00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:34.000
Huh?

319
00:18:35.666 --> 00:18:36.933
Pancham!

320
00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:39.633
Don’t give up! Just keep battling hard!

321
00:18:39.700 --> 00:18:41.700
- You can do it!
- Na-na-na-na!

322
00:18:41.766 --> 00:18:47.333
- Hm! Use Flamethrower!
- Fennekin!

323
00:18:47.399 --> 00:18:50.233
Cha, cha, cha!

324
00:18:50.300 --> 00:18:53.533
- Hidden Power!
- Fennekin!

325
00:18:57.800 --> 00:18:59.566
Go on. Throw it again!

326
00:19:00.800 --> 00:19:03.933
Pancham, I want to perform together.

327
00:19:04.000 --> 00:19:08.100
Please, come join me on my journey right now!

328
00:19:18.466 --> 00:19:22.133
Ta-da! I’ve begun a brand-new phase of my journey,

329
00:19:22.200 --> 00:19:24.200
because I caught a Pancham!

330
00:19:24.266 --> 00:19:25.800
Fenn!

331
00:19:25.866 --> 00:19:28.733
- Thanks for everything, Fennekin!
- Fenn!

332
00:19:28.800 --> 00:19:31.333
- Yeah, you did it!
- Pikachu!

333
00:19:31.399 --> 00:19:34.533
- The first time you caught a Pokémon!
- Yay!

334
00:19:34.600 --> 00:19:36.266
Thanks!

335
00:19:36.333 --> 00:19:40.733
I’m going to do my best to become a Pokémon performer like Aria.

336
00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:45.133
- Pancham?
- And someday, I’ll become Kalos Queen!

337
00:19:46.966 --> 00:19:48.966
Cha!

338
00:19:49.966 --> 00:19:55.033
Pancham, Fennekin, will you help me make my dream come true?

339
00:19:55.100 --> 00:19:56.399
- Pancham!
- Fenn!

340
00:19:56.466 --> 00:20:00.133
Awesome! I can’t wait to see you as a Pokémon performer!

341
00:20:00.200 --> 00:20:03.566
It’s good to have a goal and I think you’ve chosen the perfect one!

342
00:20:03.633 --> 00:20:06.166
- Chespin!
- That’s for sure!

343
00:20:06.233 --> 00:20:10.633
- And I'm working hard at my goal, too!
- Pikachu!

344
00:20:10.700 --> 00:20:14.399
My goal is to become an inventor who helps all Pokémon!

345
00:20:14.466 --> 00:20:19.633
You’re all so lucky! I can’t wait to grow up and become a Pokémon Trainer!

346
00:20:19.700 --> 00:20:23.866
We’re all on the road to make our dreams come true. Full speed ahead!

347
00:20:23.933 --> 00:20:25.566
Pikachu! Pika!

348
00:20:25.633 --> 00:20:31.000
So, Pancham, Fennekin, let’s do our very best!

349
00:20:33.933 --> 00:20:36.866
Serena has caught her first Pokémon, Pancham,

350
00:20:36.933 --> 00:20:40.300
and has also decided to become a Pokémon performer.

351
00:20:40.366 --> 00:20:43.833
Now, as they travel together, each with their own goal,

352
00:20:43.899 --> 00:20:46.600
our heroes journey continues!
